  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::JournalEntry
  entryTitle: Unsigned Entry
  diskItemId: data_disk_04
  entryText: 'The robots aren''t malfunctioning. They were built to survive something
    we didn''t plan for, and the radiation got into them the same way it gets into
    us. Slow, then all at once. We thought the plants were the answer. Maybe they
    are. We just didn''t have time to find out.


    time'
